  "title": "Arxis Schedules Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Release and Webcast",
  "summary": "BLOOMFIELD, Conn., July 16, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Arxis, Inc. (NASDAQ: ARXS) today announced that it will release its financial results for the second quarter of 2026 after the market closes on Wednesday, July 29, 2026. Arxis will host a conference call and webcast to discuss its financial results",
